{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05357","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 徐坚","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至德抚遐荒，神兵赴朔方。\n帝思元帅重，爰择股肱良。\n累相承安世，深筹协子房。\n寄崇专斧钺，礼备设坛场。\n鼙鼓喧雷电，戈劒凛风霜。\n四騑将戒道，十乘啓先行。\n圣锡加恒数，天文耀宠光。\n出郊开帐饮，寅饯盛离章。\n雨濯梅林润，风清麦野凉。\n燕山应勒颂，麟阁伫名扬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}